  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-learns-to-swim-v2.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "4c679acb36dbf48bb5dc5f98736ed4a44e66ad282158435823da15a18d54ac56",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f8c8b207d273778317b7a1b4c5bc8e3d72b91f0075ef34d4794f8eabffa1f81b",
      "text": "Wukong Learns\nto Swim",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c675669edd4ae55b01103e1cef809891af8f775e5a531ba619f197b5b7f5c778",
      "text": "Ao Bing swims beside the\ncoach.\n“I want to swim, too!” says\nWukong.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9ae062e314faca0074be07700e185af53e7b79da2c3ae746d7459aaee14fad48",
      "text": "But his toes curl at the pool.\n“I feel a little scared.”\n“We can go slowly,” says the\ncoach.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "bdb9a8851a8947f10278a0af54f8a8327e1f86706f3353820214ba8bbc068e8b",
      "text": "Sandy sits close to the pool.\nThe coach holds out a hand.\n“Ready?” Wukong nods.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "75f5b3e97be6c87277f899ec475f6b20e971d09f61e93147c1d6be0cfc78fbdd",
      "text": "Wukong holds the pool edge.\nThe coach stays right beside\nhim.\nAo Bing makes a tiny splash.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "00e54ce1e439ede394d8802bf40df44d16f78ded87a6b6e84113efe4a6446cab",
      "text": "Three toys bob in the pool.\nA shark, a starfish, a\nclownfish!\n“Hello, little fish!” says\nWukong.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b9e35f4f842ddb7aca1525256a338a254568412f21210c1d6c3a107406438672",
      "text": "The coach lifts a foam\nbarbell.\nIt has big blue ends.\n“Do fish lift weights?” asks\nWukong.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "faffee39d6bcc242a1f8529dff20a13bfc562cad72e3da213fc411397628f257",
      "text": "“This one helps us practice.”\nWukong grins, but holds the\nedge.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "17f12e5115c07b1de8ffb0cbe4741563ab0d7d46e06dc0dd3d0049b991684532",
      "text": "The coach blows little\nbubbles.\nWukong tries to blow bubbles,\ntoo.\nPop, pop, pop!",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0f8d35d59b28e83872d2a7f8671aa9c07bc3a5bdc20ab3c78d4121d8ae0ffdfb",
      "text": "Water tickles his chin.\nHe lifts his face and blinks.\n“A little rest,” says the\ncoach.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "941633345b4dff425bd3925a9e37c96555ecc3b4469d506773a29fc92e915f4d",
      "text": "Wukong comes back for\nanother lesson.\nHe makes more bubbles at the\nedge.\n“My bubbles are back!” he\nsays.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f9e4ecd87d76f0048e6b762b8e817a16ee60346e12d41a5acd3d675119c3c2e6",
      "text": "“Can you help me float?”\n“Yes,” says the coach.\n“I am holding you.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "30116f3d4ac1c0a204abed354e284501f1fa9e9bfbe15c52db47c7a8b2114cd9",
      "text": "Wukong starts to float with\nhelp.\nHis belly bobs like a boat.\n“A boat with a tail!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5147649c167a046d0ee7f389f308364b2e9a7ee2e6bf497e8455c7f8f0ac0e68",
      "text": "At another lesson, Wukong\ntries little kicks. “Legs\nstraight. Knees soft,” says\nthe coach. Wukong stretches\nhis legs behind him.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "93fb4d602f617cd4fa021c73f99dedc8bdcae83fa4125461188a2bfdba80b1b2",
      "text": "“Soft knees. Little kicks.”\nHis feet make small splashes.\n“The shark is watching!” says\nAo Bing.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d9bce46f7e78cfa92d0377361c79d33ef2885e9db9693f0190ea5ae70344831a",
      "text": "Wukong holds the foam\nbarbell. “Head down. Look\ninto the water.” He blows\nbubbles and kicks. The coach\nsupports him.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0dd686e5ea35cc298623c6acc356f2ba25c71cb0dbdad23ece0c1dc9a458f9c2",
      "text": "After more lessons, Wukong\ntries without it.\n“You are right here?”\n“Right here,” says the coach.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-18.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f531d473cb3204bbf945e8de2bb11d0aaaf3c64f8c407db784bf800264882519",
      "text": "He swims a little way.\nThe coach stays within reach.\nWukong turns to hold the pool\nedge.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-19.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5e93f3922c9fe404151165309579ca5ea56e1569668773105b7259ac2e523a4e",
      "text": "“I swam a little way!” says\nWukong.\n“You did!” says Ao Bing.\nThe coach helps Wukong out.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-20.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6d1a1b0950491dcd93c63c18d1349a1ffeb6ff64c395f2845c1f278474c39743",
      "text": "Three toys go in the basket.\n“Good night, little shark.”\n“You had a busy lesson, too!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-21.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b6f14abd05c0cd0e1ecc06a7a775d666ab6e243347598fcce36a91498c2c38c0",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed this story, you are welcome\nto support more. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStory and art made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
